:: Underground Colosseum Shower
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>>
<<set _cold to $xchange.colosseum.showerCold>>
<<run delete $xchange.colosseum.showerCold>>
<<if _cold>>
	You leave the hot tap off and turn on the cold water. The sudden chill makes you gasp, but you stay under it.
	<br><br>
	<<if $xchange.colosseum.injuryDays gt 0>>
		<<colosseumInjuryDescription>> You keep the injured area under the cold water for a while. The pain eases, and the swelling starts to go down.<<pain -6>><<llpain>>
	<<else>>
		You rinse the sand from your hair and body, then get out.<<pain -2>><<lpain>>
	<</if>>
	<<run Weather.BodyTemperature.update(10, 10)>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	You turn on the water and wait for it to warm up. It stays lukewarm, but it is enough to wash away the sand. The water around your feet runs brown, then faintly pink, before turning clear.
	<br><br>
	<<if $xchange.colosseum.injuryDays gt 0>>
		<<colosseumInjuryDescription>> With the dirt washed away, you can see the damage more clearly. You wash carefully around the injured area and avoid moving it more than necessary.<<pain 2>><<gpain>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		You check your arms, ribs and legs while you wash. Nothing feels badly hurt, so you finish without needing to treat anything.<<stress -6>><<llstress>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<wash>><<set $hygiene to 0>><<wearProp "soap">>
<br><br>
<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 2)>>
	The fighter at the far shower finishes washing and walks past you without trying to cover up. Neither of you is bothers with nakedness.
<<else>>
	You keep your back to the room and wash quickly. The fighter at the far shower leaves you alone, but being naked around someone else still makes you uncomfortable.<<stress 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<<fameexhibitionism 2 "none" true>>
<br><br>
<<if $awareness gte 0 or $arousal gte 9000>>
	<<skinicon "masturbate">><<link [[Masturbate|Underground Colosseum Shower Masturbation]]>><<handheldruined true true>><<set $masturbationstart to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Dry off and dress at the lockers|Underground Colosseum Washroom]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
<br>

