:: Underground Colosseum Champion Embrace
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumHost>>
<<pass 2>>
You accept the championship deal.
<br><br>
Before long, your arena name is moved to the main board. The receptionist replaces your usual match list with a single card.
"The gallery picked this one," <<he>> says, tapping it. "That's your fight."
<br><br>
Your new status also comes with better pay and protection from the grey door.
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "champion">><<set $xchange.colosseum.story to 6>><<famescrap 10 "none" true>>
<br><br>
<span class="gold">You are now the house champion.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Pit]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
