:: Underground Colosseum Champion Exploit
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<pass 1>>
You sign. The organiser closes the folder before you can read the page underneath.
"Keep winning us money. Keep your fucking hands off the paperwork."
<br><br>
The folder goes into a drawer beside the gallery desk. You have seen where the clerk keeps the key. Getting the records will mean coming back, finding a gap in the watch, and copying them yourself.
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "inside">><<set $xchange.colosseum.story to 6>><<set $xchange.colosseum.records to {count: 0, nextAt: $timeStamp}>><<famescrap 5 "none" true>>
