:: Underground Colosseum Champion Disrupt Open
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>>
<<pass 2>>
The guard desk is empty. You take the keys from behind it and unlock the rooms.
<br><br>
The first fighter backs away when you open their door.
"You can leave," you say. "I'm getting out through the delivery door. Come with me before the guard comes back."
<br><br>
You give the same choice to the other fighters.
<br><br>
Four decide to follow you. Two stay behind. One says they still need the money they earn here to pay debts outside the Colosseum. The other asks you to leave them alone.
<br><br>
You do not try to change their minds.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Champion Disrupt 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Champion Disrupt 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>>
You lead the four fighters through the storage room and out through the delivery door.
<br><br>
Security notices the escape before you reach the street. People shout from inside as workers rush towards the back of the Colosseum, but you are already in the alley.
<br><br>
The fighters separate once you are far enough away. One stays close to you until you reach the main street, then quickly leaves with the others.
<br><br>
The Colosseum bans you for interfering with its fighters. They cannot simply remove your name or pretend you were never there, however. Too many spectators already know who you are.
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "disrupted">><<set $xchange.colosseum.story to 6>><<set $xchange.colosseum.banUntil to Time.date.timeStamp + 259200>><<famegood 10>><<trauma -10>><<llltrauma>>
