:: Underground Colosseum Champion Walk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>>
<<pass 2>>
You refuse the championship offer and tell them you are finished with the Colosseum.
<br><br>
The person with the folder writes down your answer. Nobody tries to stop you as you leave the gallery.
At the exit, the attendant steps in front of you. "Search first."
<br><br>
They check your pockets, waistband and shoes for anything taken from upstairs. Finding nothing, they open the door.
<br><br>
The attendant crosses your name from the booking list. "Done means done. You can still come back to watch, but don't ask me for another fight."
<br><br>
You pass the grey door on your way out. Some fighters are still living below, fighting to pay off what they owe.
You keep walking, nevertheless.
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "walked">><<set $xchange.colosseum.story to 6>><<trauma 5>><<gtrauma>>
