"I was hoping I'd see you. They put me against a D-rank."
<br><br>
<<He>> smiles. "I won." <<He>> takes a folded banknote from inside <<his>> robe and holds it out to you.
<br><br>
You hesitate, but <<he>> pushes it into your hand.
"You helped me when those two trapped me by the cages. This is part of what I earned from that fight. I need most of it for myself, but I wanted to give you something."
<<money 50000 "colosseum">><<famegood 2>><<stress -4>><<llstress>><<colosseumHeat 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Watcher
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>>
<<pass 3>><<silverStrangerInit>>
<<set $daily.colosseumWatcher to 1>>
<<if $xchange.silverStranger.met>>
	<<set $xchange.colosseum.watcherSeen to Math.min(3, ($xchange.colosseum.watcherSeen ?? 0) + 1)>>
	During a break between fights, you glance towards the highest row of seats. The Silver Stranger is there again.
	<br><br>
	They sit alone near the end of the row. The Colosseum is crowded, but several seats around them are empty. They have no drink or betting slip. Instead of watching the fight below, they are watching you.
	<br><br>
	When you notice them, they smile. They make no attempt to approach you and remain where they are.
	<br><br>
	<<if $xchange.colosseum.watcherSeen gte 3>>
		You have seen them here several times now, always sitting in the same area.
		After noticing them on previous visits, you tried watching the nearby stairs. You still never saw them arrive or leave.
		<<set $xchange.colosseum.watcherAsk to 1>>
	<<else>>
		The announcer calls the next fight, drawing your attention back to the pit. When you look towards the upper seats again, the Silver Stranger is gone.
		You check the stairway beneath their row. You did not see them pass through it.
	<</if>>
	<<colosseumHeat 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Terraces]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<set $xchange.silverStranger.unlocked to true>>
	While the crowd watches the fight below, you notice someone sitting alone in the highest row.
	<br><br>
	Several seats around them are empty even though people elsewhere are standing because they cannot find anywhere to sit. The crowd shouts after a heavy hit in the pit, but the figure does not move.
	<br><br>
	<<if $hallucinations gte 1>>
		When you look more closely, pale antlers seem to rise from their head. Their face appears almost completely dark beneath them, with only the eye sockets clearly visible.
	<<else>>
		Two large shapes rise from either side of their head. From this distance, they resemble antlers, though you cannot tell whether they are real or part of a mask.
	<</if>>
	No one in the nearby rows seems interested in the figure. Some do not appear to notice them at all.
	<br><br>
	An emergency light near the gate flashes across the upper seats. The light reaches part of the figure's face, revealing a wide smile aimed towards the pit.
	Your shoulders pull back and you quickly look away.<<awareness 1>><<gawareness>><<trauma 12>><<gggtrauma>><<stress 8>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Watcher 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

